{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":58820016,"ns":0,"title":"Buttressed core","extract":"A buttressed core is a structural system for high buildings, consisting of a hexagonal core reinforced by three buttresses that form a Y shape.\nThe buttressed core was invented by the Skidmore, Owings & Merrill engineer Bill Baker.","description":"Structural system for high buildings","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}